{"1324780":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Easy Red 2","steam_appid":1324780,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[2317930,4563790,1888350,3499380,2617770],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>We hit the beach in 30 seconds. Stay alert. Stay alive.<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Red II is a tactical, realistic, historically authentic World War II shooter focused on large-scale, immersive battles that put you right on the front lines of the chaos.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your squad, coordinate combined-arms assaults, and fight across sprawling battlefields modeled after real historical locations of war. Playable completely solo against AI, or take the fight to other players.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Global War<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight all across the globe. In the base game, Easy Red II features 6 extensive campaigns: <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anzio, Italy<\/strong>: a brutal bloody stalemate between Axis and Allied forces lasting for months in the central Italian plains in 1944. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monte Cassino, Italy<\/strong>: a rugged mountainous campaign where Allied forces waged many attacks on the Gustav Line. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tunisia<\/strong>: the final stand of German forces in North Africa in 1943. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation Flintlock<\/strong>: taking place on the Marshall Islands of Kwajalein and Roi-Namur: a joint operation by U.S. Army Pacific and Marine forces respectively to take captured Japanese Empire-held islands in early 1944. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battle of Makin<\/strong>: a battle coinciding with the iconic battle of Tarawa in which U.S. Army Pacific forces invaded the Makin Atoll, furthering their Island-hopping efforts in late 1943. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Invasion of Kos<\/strong>: the Greek island occupied by Italians and invaded by German forces in 1943. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across all of these campaigns, there are <strong>over 100 unique missions.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/54a40dd43285ce45247af1ed4c09e2b0.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/54a40dd43285ce45247af1ed4c09e2b0.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Red II also features affordable DLC expansion packs, ranging from the <i>Eastern Front in Stalingrad<\/i>, the <i>Western Front in Normandy<\/i> and even across to the war-torn streets of <i>Shanghai, China<\/i>. These DLC campaigns add time-accurate vehicles, factions, and weapons—as well as over <strong>80 additional missions combined.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consistently Updated<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Red II is forever evolving. Whether it be AI overhauls, animation updates, free vehicle, weapon, or uniform additions, the game is sure to be constantly improving as time goes on. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Into War<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Easy Red II, we put you right in the shoes of the average soldier on the battlefield, fighting in recreated historical locations from the Second World War with historically authentic troop movements and orders of battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/6e0e9c0924986c0678c58d59553804c3.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/6e0e9c0924986c0678c58d59553804c3.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>aren't<\/i> a special super soldier—you must traverse your way through roars of gunfire and shell-shocking explosions as you progress through the battlefield. Your survival is not guaranteed. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Squad-Focused Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No man is sent in alone. In Easy Red II, you can control squads of soldiers with various roles: Squad Leader, Radioman, Medic, Support Gunner, and more—all with unique abilities allowing you to change the tide of any battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/2784cd43cc6b5880a8cc738e70a2486b.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/2784cd43cc6b5880a8cc738e70a2486b.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanized Warfare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate iconic tanks from World War II, featuring detailed armor penetration, ballistics, and crew mechanics. If you lose a crew member, you may lose a function of your vehicle as well. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/042d5737e5e95cc53db044e7dbb97156.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/042d5737e5e95cc53db044e7dbb97156.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some iconic vehicles range from the <strong>M4 Sherman, Willys Jeep, Churchill, Panther and Tiger tanks<\/strong> on the ground to aerial vehicles such as the <strong>Spitfire, P-51 Mustang, P-40 Warhawk, P-38 Lightning, F4F Wildcat and Bf 109<\/strong> in the air, with many more. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Environments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is not static. Forests are leveled, defenses torn apart, and buildings are reduced to rubble over the course of a battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/4d8278d1ecc6c0b7891358a3c28105d8.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/4d8278d1ecc6c0b7891358a3c28105d8.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online in both PvP and Co-op with friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions from the base game, the Steam Workshop, or from a custom mission you created yourself.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friend's squad or play with your own.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a match whenever you want, wherever you want, on any map you want.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/02935b4892aea474b9bd904b4e4cbb2b.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/02935b4892aea474b9bd904b4e4cbb2b.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share <strong>your own scenarios<\/strong>, maps, and other custom content through the <strong>easily accessible<\/strong> integrated map and mission editor.<br>Create <strong>mods<\/strong> with the dedicated <strong>Modding SDK<\/strong>.<br>Share your creation on the <strong>Steam Workshop<\/strong> and play them in <strong>Singleplayer<\/strong> or <strong>Multiplayer<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/c2271fff3a1698b8042a83296009d1c7.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/c2271fff3a1698b8042a83296009d1c7.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Three... Two... One... Drop the ramp.<\/i><\/h2>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>We hit the beach in 30 seconds. Stay alert. Stay alive.<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Red II is a tactical, realistic, historically authentic World War II shooter focused on large-scale, immersive battles that put you right on the front lines of the chaos.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your squad, coordinate combined-arms assaults, and fight across sprawling battlefields modeled after real historical locations of war. Playable completely solo against AI, or take the fight to other players.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Global War<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight all across the globe. In the base game, Easy Red II features 6 extensive campaigns: <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anzio, Italy<\/strong>: a brutal bloody stalemate between Axis and Allied forces lasting for months in the central Italian plains in 1944. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monte Cassino, Italy<\/strong>: a rugged mountainous campaign where Allied forces waged many attacks on the Gustav Line. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tunisia<\/strong>: the final stand of German forces in North Africa in 1943. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation Flintlock<\/strong>: taking place on the Marshall Islands of Kwajalein and Roi-Namur: a joint operation by U.S. Army Pacific and Marine forces respectively to take captured Japanese Empire-held islands in early 1944. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battle of Makin<\/strong>: a battle coinciding with the iconic battle of Tarawa in which U.S. Army Pacific forces invaded the Makin Atoll, furthering their Island-hopping efforts in late 1943. <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Invasion of Kos<\/strong>: the Greek island occupied by Italians and invaded by German forces in 1943. <\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across all of these campaigns, there are <strong>over 100 unique missions.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/54a40dd43285ce45247af1ed4c09e2b0.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/54a40dd43285ce45247af1ed4c09e2b0.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Red II also features affordable DLC expansion packs, ranging from the <i>Eastern Front in Stalingrad<\/i>, the <i>Western Front in Normandy<\/i> and even across to the war-torn streets of <i>Shanghai, China<\/i>. These DLC campaigns add time-accurate vehicles, factions, and weapons—as well as over <strong>80 additional missions combined.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Consistently Updated<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy Red II is forever evolving. Whether it be AI overhauls, animation updates, free vehicle, weapon, or uniform additions, the game is sure to be constantly improving as time goes on. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Into War<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Easy Red II, we put you right in the shoes of the average soldier on the battlefield, fighting in recreated historical locations from the Second World War with historically authentic troop movements and orders of battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/6e0e9c0924986c0678c58d59553804c3.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/6e0e9c0924986c0678c58d59553804c3.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>aren't<\/i> a special super soldier—you must traverse your way through roars of gunfire and shell-shocking explosions as you progress through the battlefield. Your survival is not guaranteed. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Squad-Focused Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No man is sent in alone. In Easy Red II, you can control squads of soldiers with various roles: Squad Leader, Radioman, Medic, Support Gunner, and more—all with unique abilities allowing you to change the tide of any battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/2784cd43cc6b5880a8cc738e70a2486b.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/2784cd43cc6b5880a8cc738e70a2486b.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanized Warfare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate iconic tanks from World War II, featuring detailed armor penetration, ballistics, and crew mechanics. If you lose a crew member, you may lose a function of your vehicle as well. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/042d5737e5e95cc53db044e7dbb97156.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/042d5737e5e95cc53db044e7dbb97156.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some iconic vehicles range from the <strong>M4 Sherman, Willys Jeep, Churchill, Panther and Tiger tanks<\/strong> on the ground to aerial vehicles such as the <strong>Spitfire, P-51 Mustang, P-40 Warhawk, P-38 Lightning, F4F Wildcat and Bf 109<\/strong> in the air, with many more. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Environments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is not static. Forests are leveled, defenses torn apart, and buildings are reduced to rubble over the course of a battle. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/4d8278d1ecc6c0b7891358a3c28105d8.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/4d8278d1ecc6c0b7891358a3c28105d8.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online in both PvP and Co-op with friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions from the base game, the Steam Workshop, or from a custom mission you created yourself.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friend's squad or play with your own.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a match whenever you want, wherever you want, on any map you want.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/02935b4892aea474b9bd904b4e4cbb2b.poster.avif?t=1785026019\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\/extras\/02935b4892aea474b9bd904b4e4cbb2b.mp4?t=1785026019\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share <strong>your own scenarios<\/strong>, maps, and other custom content through the <strong>easily accessible<\/strong> integrated map and mission editor.<br>Create <strong>mods<\/strong> with the dedicated <strong>Modding SDK<\/strong>.<br>Share your creation on the <strong>Steam Workshop<\/strong> and play them in <strong>Singleplayer<\/strong> or <strong>Multiplayer<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1324780\